hich of the following statements is correct?\n\nA. Children with eczema should not ingest peanuts.\n\nB. Children with eczema should eat peanuts at an early stage.\n\nC. Parents should avoid feeding every kind of food that can cause an allergic reaction to their\nchildren.", "sourcePage": 53, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 60, "source": {"id": "offline-0300375e981d9b16a421", "filename": "Listening Tests 1 - 15.pdf", "sha256": "0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 27, "prompt": "You hear the discussion between physicians on the importance of food challenge\n\nWhich of the following statements best suits this extract?\n\nA. Food challenge test becomes inevitable with patients with food allergies\n\nB. Food allergy tests are an alternative to the food challenge test.\n\nC. Food allergy tests carry lots of false positives.", "sourcePage": 53, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "A", "page": 60, "source": {"id": "offline-0300375e981d9b16a421", "filename": "Listening Tests 1 - 15.pdf", "sha256": "0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 28, "prompt": "You hear a discussion between doctors on fake Stop the Bleed kits.\n\n        Which of the following statements is correct?\n\n        A. Counterfeit tourniquets would probably cost between 25 to 35 dollars.\n\n        B. Genuine tourniquets range from 25 to 35 dollars.\n\n        C. One should not buy Stop the Bleed kits for a cost lesser than 25 dollars.", "sourcePage": 54, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 60, "source": {"id": "offline-0300375e981d9b16a421", "filename": "Listening Tests 1 - 15.pdf", "sha256": "0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 29, "prompt": "You hear a physician explaining to his nurse about causes of obesity.\n\n        Which of the following is the main cause for obesity?\n\n        A. The interaction between genes and the bacteria in our guts\n\n        B. The interaction between the diet we eat, our genes, and our bacteria in our body.\n\n        C. Genes colonized with bacteria that produce more nutrients for the host.", "sourcePage": 54, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "C", "page": 60, "source": {"id": "offline-0300375e981d9b16a421", "filename": "Listening Tests 1 - 15.pdf", "sha256": "0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 30, "prompt": "You hear a physician briefing staff about the Herpes virus infection.\n\n        Which of the following is not a symptom of the Herpes virus infection.\n\n        A. Tingling\n\n        B. Bleeding\n\n        C. Swollen lymph nodes\n\n                                            Part C\nIn this part of the test, you'll hear two different extracts. In each extract, you'll hear health\nprofessionals talking about specific aspects of their work.\n\nFor questions, 31 to 42 choose the answer (A, B, or C) which fits best according to what you\nhear. Complete the answers as you listen the audio.\n\nNow, look at extract one.", "sourcePage": 54, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 60, "source": {"id": "offline-0300375e981d9b16a421", "filename": "Listening Tests 1 - 15.pdf", "sha256": "0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}], "skills": ["listening"], "recordings": ["d3530ea9167357b47346d24e57937046571708a650a5b8d2e0f519047b4ade81"], "answerSources": [{"id": "offline-0300375e981d9b16a421", "filename": "Listening Tests 1 - 15.pdf", "sha256": "0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper", "pages": [60]}], "matchEvidence": "Reviewed patient cases and question topics in the exact-recording transcript against the printed task paper; task filename alone is not used"}, {"id": "british-academy-task-5-C", "label": "British Academy · Task 5 · Part C", "part": "C", "sourceSha256": "0300375e981d9b16a4214982bdc40c52b4b76d2e6197811448bc8dcb96f2f8fc", "pages": [55, 56, 57, 58, 59]